                                                "text": "The delivery was completed by four."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a8dfe06-23cd-4c83-af26-fe2bd1bd12cb",
                                                "sense_id": "51a119f0-e9ee-3924-8a77-89077228f3df",
                                                "text": "delivery of a nuclear missile to its target"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f922ad9-f1d8-3c9b-b8a6-26fb1fb65814",
                                        "entry_id": "7a73f5c9-62e9-3c11-b34b-3be00784c762",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The item which has been conveyed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d27f9eff-c560-4b36-b877-ac99ad0fe200",
                                                "sense_id": "2f922ad9-f1d8-3c9b-b8a6-26fb1fb65814",
                                                "text": "Your delivery is on the table."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0152c188-7538-3b6e-aacb-5006a6b30c10",
                                        "entry_id": "7a73f5c9-62e9-3c11-b34b-3be00784c762",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of giving birth"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05f9f5a0-f145-4bc7-b691-aeb9e4561058",
                                                "sense_id": "0152c188-7538-3b6e-aacb-5006a6b30c10",
                                                "text": "The delivery was painful."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2d3e6e9-5657-4f8e-a371-1223f06ac58c",
                                                "sense_id": "0152c188-7538-3b6e-aacb-5006a6b30c10",
                                                "text": "During pregnancy, the Queen had been more than twice as wide as she was tall, and the act of delivery took three months and six days after it had begun."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67fffbb0-4c9c-311c-b669-909420e1a100",
                                        "entry_id": "7a73f5c9-62e9-3c11-b34b-3be00784c762",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pitching motion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96ceb184-ced6-4779-b1da-2aca3dcbffd4",
                                                "sense_id": "67fffbb0-4c9c-311c-b669-909420e1a100",
                                                "text": "His delivery has a catch in it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "662ec73d-1d94-3ff5-bdc2-b266d17f81a3",
                                        "entry_id": "7a73f5c9-62e9-3c11-b34b-3be00784c762",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thrown pitch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "402c5253-952c-4129-b09c-01b10d5ec556",
                                                "sense_id": "662ec73d-1d94-3ff5-bdc2-b266d17f81a3",
                                                "text": "Here is the delivery; ... strike three!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe251ea5-7837-3cc7-8c6b-4544be4a5483",
                                        "entry_id": "7a73f5c9-62e9-3c11-b34b-3be00784c762",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The manner of speaking or singing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fe3c8a6-d427-4453-b52b-168c5760cfaf",
                                                "sense_id": "fe251ea5-7837-3cc7-8c6b-4544be4a5483",
                                                "text": "The actor's delivery was flawless."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a3a8ba5-ec3a-4972-8663-622588129237",
                                                "sense_id": "fe251ea5-7837-3cc7-8c6b-4544be4a5483",
                                                "text": "I shall not tell what Dr. Coutras related to me in his words, but in my own, for I cannot hope to give at second hand any impression of his vivacious delivery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8558e598-9efd-4a68-ad53-c1588ff62c6d",
                                                "sense_id": "fe251ea5-7837-3cc7-8c6b-4544be4a5483",
                                                "text": "Half of the comedy in West’s self-deprecating appearance on “Mr. Plow” comes from the veteran actor’s purring, self-satisfied delivery as he tells a deeply unnerved Bart and Lisa of the newfangled, less groovy cinematic Batman"
                                            }
                                        ]
